Usage: agent-deck triggers mute <id> [--for 24h] [--json]

Mute a trigger at the receiving end: its sends are accepted, logged with
outcome muted and never typed into the pane. The host job keeps running;
agent-deck never pauses, stops or disables it. The mute expires on its own.

Options:
  -for duration
    	How long the mute lasts (default 24h0m0s)
  -json
    	Output as JSON
